name: The Sink
theme: desert
objective: hold
doctrine: hunters
order: 18
duration: 45
mechanic: quicksand as a shape
brief: Firm ground in the middle and sinks all round it. Four waves come out of the huts, and every one of them has to wade. They cannot fire while they do.
waves: 4@11
tile: 16
